<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-4450] Explicit lock is not released when node that acquired it is killed</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4450</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Test is attached. The scenario is the following:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start first node and create a transactional cache.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start second node and acquire a lock.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Kill second node after several seconds without doing unlock.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Try to start third node. It can&apos;t join because the lock is still held for some reason. The result if hanged cluster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
</description>
                <environment></environment>
        <key id="13028814">IGNITE-4450</key>
            <summary>Explicit lock is not released when node that acquired it is killed</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=21133&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
