                        <due></due>
                            <votes>0</votes>
                                    <watches>5</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15760665" author="sboikov" created="Mon, 19 Dec 2016 09:24:49 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Found reason of hang: when second node is killed &apos;affinity change&apos; exchange is in progress and exchange worker waits for locks release. But callback removing locks for failed node is called only when exchange for node fail will start, so &apos;affinity change&apos; exchange never finish. Need fix GridDhtPartitionsExchangeFuture to also call &apos;removeExplicitNodeLocks&apos; when it receive s&apos;node fail&apos; events. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15769475" author="sboikov" created="Thu, 22 Dec 2016 08:31:05 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed in master.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15925698" author="evans_ye" created="Wed, 15 Mar 2017 07:57:07 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Hi team,&lt;br/&gt;
This is fixed and committed to the code base, however I can&apos;t find patch file or PR attached on this JIRA.&lt;br/&gt;
It would be better to have the code attached here so that user/developer can reference and learn how the bug gets fixed.&lt;br/&gt;
BTW, thanks for the fix.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
